onfirmed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]cancel), and every GTD review landing and the review footer say in [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a few words which priority that key would use and whether it [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]decays.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]quick_roll_alt_p.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/quick_roll_alt_p.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-aq[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-aq/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The one-key roll command in bob-navigation-hotkeys[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]quick-roll-key[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]quick-roll-key: add the Task card roll-by-recommendation command on the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chosen key, run it as a one-shot Task Card intent that stays invisible [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unless input is needed, alias the key inside the card, rebind the vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hotkey, and document it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Roll preview on review-walk landings and api.quickRoll[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]review-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after quick-roll-key[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review-preview: extract one shared recommendation planner, format the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]concise roll preview, add it as the last line of `]s` landing toasts, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and expose it as the additive nav `api.quickRoll` v1 namespace.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Roll preview in the review footer[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]footer-preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after review-preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer-preview: bob-ledger-tools shows the compact preview in the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]footer's hint slot and the full sentence in its tooltip while the cursor[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is on a review row.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Review contract, API contract, and memory updates in bob-cli[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]review-docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after quick-roll-key, review-preview, footer-preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]review-docs: update the freshness review ritual and the nav API contract[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in bob-cli docs, apply the accepted memory decisions, and regenerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generated docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-aq","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-aq.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-aq.1"},"source_run_id":"run-1ae72e42a9be215e8a423d4440208c1e","started_at":"2026-10-23T10:37:13.305232+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"608ceea42c0f33ae4635bd399b2fe6a43b35dc1187a92f88923bba810856bf3d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-aq.1--1/chat.md","size_bytes":11089},"commits":{"digest":"4e81802c41e46c27770192ba2be635a980abe9b5649d4829b00cbb3242a29981","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-aq.1--1/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"29de63297e2ad53a65